sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 前端客户端
    participant F as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant AC as AuthController / AuthService
    participant LG as LoginAttemptGuard
    participant JWT as JwtService (HS256)
    participant SEC as PreAuthorize RBAC 代理
    participant AUD as AuditService (REQUIRES_NEW)

    rect rgb(238,242,255)
    Note over C,AUD: 阶段一：账号口令登录与失败限流
    C->>AC: POST /api/v1/auth/login (username, password)
    AC->>LG: blocked(username) 校验 5 分钟失败窗口
    alt 连续失败 >= 5 次
        LG-->>AC: 触发限流锁定
        AC->>AUD: record(LOGIN, success=false)
        AC-->>C: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests
    else 允许尝试认证
        AC->>AC: UserRepository 查询 + BCrypt 校验
        alt 凭据无效或账号禁用
            AC->>LG: recordFailure(username)
            AC->>AUD: record(LOGIN, success=false)
            AC-->>C: HTTP 401 (code=40100)
        else 认证通过
            AC->>LG: recordSuccess(username) 清零计数
            AC->>JWT: issue(user) 签发含 uid/role 的 HS256 JWT
            JWT-->>AC: Bearer Token
            AC->>AUD: record(LOGIN, success=true)
            AC-->>C: HTTP 200 (token, expiresIn, user)
        end
    end
    end

    rect rgb(239,246,241)
    Note over C,AUD: 阶段二：无状态请求鉴权与三级权限拦截
    C->>F: 受保护 REST 请求 + Authorization Bearer JWT
    F->>JWT: parse(token) 验签并提取 UserPrincipal
    alt 令牌缺失、伪造或过期
        F-->>C: AuthenticationEntryPoint -> HTTP 401 (code=40100)
    else 身份上下文写入 SecurityContext
        F->>SEC: 放行进入方法级安全代理
        alt 角色不满足 hasRole / hasAnyRole
            SEC-->>C: AccessDeniedHandler -> HTTP 403 (code=40300)
        else 角色校验通过（ADMIN / OPS / VIEWER）
            SEC->>AUD: 业务执行并独立事务写入审计日志
            SEC-->>C: HTTP 200 ApiResponse(code=0)
        end
    end
    end
